  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8\\end{aligned}].$",
  "worked_solution": "Let's start by writing the matrix $B-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nB-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(B-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-8-\\lambda )(8-\\lambda )-7\\cdot (-9) & =0 \\\\ -64+8\\lambda -8\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+63 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +1)(\\lambda -1) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =1.$",
